---
import UxCard from "../UxCard.astro";
import Icon from "../icons/Icon.astro";
---

<UxCard
  id="N-11"
  domain="Navigation"
  domainClass="d-n"
  title=`Ask for Notifications<br/>After Showing Their Value`
  rule=`<strong>Permission prompts fail when the user has no context for what they're agreeing to.</strong> Link the ask to a specific action the user just took. The value exchange is clear, and they're far more likely to say yes.`
>
<div class="notif-demo n11-visual">
<div class="notif-item notif-bad">
<span class="notif-icon"><Icon name="Bell" size={16} class="ux-icon" /></span>
<div class="notif-text"><strong>"Can we send you notifications?"</strong>: Asked on first launch, before doing anything. User has no reason to say yes. Declined forever.</div>
</div>
<div class="notif-item notif-good">
<span class="notif-icon"><Icon name="Check" size={13} class="ux-icon" /></span>
<div class="notif-text"><strong>User turns on price tracking.</strong> "Want to be notified when this drops?": Now they have a specific reason. Permission granted.</div>
</div>
</div>
</UxCard>
